{"translation-revision-date":"2026-09-14 00:00+0000","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/ext-sticky-header.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"fr_FR","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);"},"Sticky Header":[""],"Enable Sticky Header":[""],"Shadow Size":["Taille de la fl\u00e8che"],"Small":[""],"Medium":["M\u00e9dias"],"Large":["Cible du lien"],"Shrink Amount (%)":[""],"None":["Aucun"],"Sticky header is disabled in DesignSetGo Settings. Enable it in Settings > DesignSetGo to use these controls.":[""],"Configure sticky header behavior for this template part.":[""],"Make this header stick to the top when scrolling.":[""],"Shadow depth when scrolled.":[""],"Hide on Scroll Down":["Animer au d\u00e9filement"],"Auto-hide when scrolling down, show when scrolling up.":[""],"Background on Scroll":["Couleur d'arri\u00e8re-plan"],"Use global background color setting when scrolled.":["La couleur d'arri\u00e8re-plan est d\u00e9finie dans le panneau \"Couleur\" ci-dessous."],"Additional settings like z-index, transition speed, and background color can be configured in DesignSetGo Settings.":[""],"Shrink Logo on Scroll":[""],"Scale down images (site logo, image blocks) inside the header when scrolled. Keeps aspect ratio \u2014 works for wide or tall logos.":[""],"How much to shrink the logo. 40% means scaled to 60% of original size.":[""],"Skip Top Bar on Scroll":[""],"If your header has a top bar (e.g. social links), it scrolls away before the nav sticks.":[""]}}}